 ● Ritual Summon 1 Reptile Ritual Monster from your Deck, by Tributing Reptile monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels equal the Level of the Ritual Monster.
 ● Ritual Summon 1 Reptile Ritual Monster from your hand, by Tributing up to 2 Reptile monsters from your hand, Deck, or field, whose total Levels equal the Level of the Ritual Monster.

If this card is sent to the GY: [b]You can[/b] activate 1 of these effects (but [b]you can[/b] only use each effect of "Volcanic Rimfire" [b]once[/b] [b]per turn[/b]);
● [b]Banish[/b] this card from your GY, [b]and if you do[/b], send 1 "Volcanic" monster from your Deck to the GY, except "Volcanic Rimfire".
● [b]Banish[/b] 1 "Blaze Accelerator" card from your face-up field or GY, [b]and if you do[/b], place 1 "Blaze Accelerator" Continuous Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck face-up on your field.

